        <td style="border: 1px dashed #333; padding: 8px;"><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 4px 0 8px 0;"><b>Scenario:</b> Learning from Mistakes</p></td>
        <td style="border: 1px dashed #333; padding: 8px;"><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 4px 0 8px 0;"><b>Theme:</b> Next Time, I Will Study Harder to Avoid...</p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="border: 1px dashed #333;">
